<string name="Text">HOTFIX 9/30/25

OVERHAULED HITBOX SYSTEM

as explained before hitboxes now got a massive overhaul and will be more consistent especially if you are in lower ping.


MISC ADDITIONS

Customizable Aura
You are now able to change generators, survivors, killer and exit levers aura colors.

New &quot;The Killer&quot; suspense and chase soundtrack.

New two window vault animations that alternate on random
Updated pallet interaction animations; drop, both vaults.
Refined the getting hit animation from healthy to injured.


MAP ADJUSTMENTS AND ADDITIONS:
Slight adjustment and fixes to the layout of Mercy Rooftop.
Added new variant to Bloodbath Club.
Fixed Rooftop not showing end screen cutscene.


NEW EMOTES

Arm swing
Griddy

NEW SKIN:

New Abysswalker skin &quot;Le Pourpre&quot;


KILLER AND KILLER PERK ADJUSTMENTS:

Slasher perks:
Brutal strength bonus speed buffed from 10/15/20% to 20/30/40%
Offscreen scare buffed from 2/4/6% bonus speed outside of chase to 6/8/10%
(alot of people complained about brutal strength not being noticeable at all and not worth to take 1/3 of your build, same with offscreenscare being underwhelming especially due to the maps being big)

Stalker:
stalking does not stop you in place from far away, instead slows you to normal stalk speed
Stalker&apos;s climax scene mode (T2/T3) buffed from 45 to 70

(the stalking speed change is to make him more viable if the map is open and he cant sneak around.
Alot of people also complained that his mode does not stay long enough in the match so it has been altered)

Stalker	Perks:
Eternal torment changed from 10/15/20 seconds of vulnerability (hitting someone instantly brings them to the downed state) to 20/25/30 seconds but increased the cooldown from 30 seconds to 40.
Play With Your Food bonus movement speed buffed from 1/2/3% speed to 5/6/7%
Predator cooldown buffed from 60/50/40 to 40/35/30

(changed eternal torment because sometimes you would get no value in the whole match.)

(play with your food&apos;s reward did not justify dropping a whole chase for it, hence the buff)

(and finally a pretty straight forward buff to an aura reading perk)

Jacket Perks:
Combo Streak now does not work with jeff&apos;s frenzy or other special attacks like abysswalker&apos;s slash or hidden&apos;s lunge.
Crackdown buffed from +2/+4/+6 damage to gens when kicking to 5/10/15.

(combo streak is self explanatory, and crackdown felt underwhelming especially for being a perk that requires 45 levels)

The Killer:
Buffed frenzy speed buff from +3 stud per sec movement speed to +4
The Killer perks:
resentment clinger now rewards chaining survivors by +2 tokens
Sloppy mess healing debuff increased from 15/20/25% 30/35/40%

(hopefully would make the killer not be D tier after the speed buff especially after taking away the combo streak cheese.
made resentment clinger more flexible and not just rely on getting stunned
with how many perks survivors have to boost healing speed its only fair for killer perks numbers to mirror the other side)


GENERAL ADJUSTMENTS AND BUG FIXES

Healing someone does not require them to not be sprinting anymore as long you are standing still and not moving you can be healed, should avoid confusion especially in mobile players that always sprint on

Fixed a bug where sometimes playing pc/phone with controller broke for killers.

Added vfx for when &quot;Abyssal covenant&quot; perk procs.

Healing does not keep you in the air anymore
Fixed jeff being able to cancel frenzy&apos;s end punishment by hitting a wall at the end of frenzy
Fixed being able to interact with stuff while ragdolled
Fixed The stalker&apos;s grab dash making him scale walls
Fixed the stalker&apos;s grab not stopping when getting stunned
The stalker&apos;s grab now also checks for line of sight
You cant get money in the lobby anymore for escaping while on chase
Cleaned up the chases better when a survivor escapes it doesnt keep killers stuck in chase
Fixed dying randomly after getting chained if you spam self unchain
Fixed adrenaline item soft locking the killer if he gets up as soon as getting picked up
