<float name="LineHeight">0.750000000000</float>
<string name="LocalizedText">A Masked sadistic individual obsessed with survivors. Plays around survivors like food, often saving the obsession for the last, as for the other survivors, last thing they hear is his heavy breath under his mask.</string>
<string name="Name">Desc</string>
<UDim2 name="Position">
<XS>0.490000009537</XS>
<XO>0</XO>
<YS>-0.009999984875</YS>
