<Style>Normal</Style>
</Font>
<float name="LineHeight">0.750000000000</float>
<string name="LocalizedText">Stalker mode is the first tier that the Stalker starts in.
During this time, the Stalker is &lt;font color=&quot;#4CFF7A&quot;&gt;permanently Undetectable&lt;/font&gt; until the mode ends.

Movement speed during this mode is: &lt;font color=&quot;#FFD24C&quot;&gt;110% / 18.7 Studs per second&lt;/font&gt;
To leave this mode, the Stalker has to gain a total of &lt;font color=&quot;#FFD24C&quot;&gt;5.0 charges&lt;/font&gt; of Stalk, after which &lt;font color=&quot;#B97CFF&quot;&gt;Evil&apos;s Grasp&lt;/font&gt; is unlocked and ready to use.  
The Stalker must stalk a survivor for &lt;font color=&quot;#FFD24C&quot;&gt;5 seconds&lt;/font&gt;, gaining &lt;font color=&quot;#FFD24C&quot;&gt;1 charge&lt;/font&gt; per second depending on distance.
Chaining a survivor in this mode fills &lt;font color=&quot;#FFD24C&quot;&gt;40%&lt;/font&gt; of the Stalk meter. Each Chain in Hunter mode saves &lt;font color=&quot;#FFD24C&quot;&gt;20%&lt;/font&gt; for when he comes back to this mode.
</string>
<string name="Name">Par1</string>
<UDim2 name="Position">
<XS>0.490000039339</XS>
<XO>0</XO>
<YS>0.558000028133</YS>
<YO>0</YO>
</UDim2>
<bool name="RichText">true</bool>
<UDim2 name="Size">
<XS>0.939999938011</XS>
<XO>0</XO>
<YS>0.425890386105</YS>
<YO>0</YO>
</UDim2>
<string name="Text">Stalker mode is the first tier that the Stalker starts in.
During this time, the Stalker is &lt;font color=&quot;#4CFF7A&quot;&gt;permanently Undetectable&lt;/font&gt; until the mode ends.

Movement speed during this mode is: &lt;font color=&quot;#FFD24C&quot;&gt;110% / 18.7 Studs per second&lt;/font&gt;
To leave this mode, the Stalker has to gain a total of &lt;font color=&quot;#FFD24C&quot;&gt;5.0 charges&lt;/font&gt; of Stalk, after which &lt;font color=&quot;#B97CFF&quot;&gt;Evil&apos;s Grasp&lt;/font&gt; is unlocked and ready to use.  
The Stalker must stalk a survivor for &lt;font color=&quot;#FFD24C&quot;&gt;5 seconds&lt;/font&gt;, gaining &lt;font color=&quot;#FFD24C&quot;&gt;1 charge&lt;/font&gt; per second depending on distance.
Chaining a survivor in this mode fills &lt;font color=&quot;#FFD24C&quot;&gt;40%&lt;/font&gt; of the Stalk meter. Each Chain in Hunter mode saves &lt;font color=&quot;#FFD24C&quot;&gt;20%&lt;/font&gt; for when he comes back to this mode.
</string>
