<Style>Normal</Style>
</Font>
<float name="LineHeight">0.750000000000</float>
<string name="LocalizedText">Stalking and hunting is familiar enough to know everything from your victims. Whenever a &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; escapes a chase, their &lt;font color=&quot;#C29EFF&quot;&gt;aura&lt;/font&gt; is revealed to you for &lt;font color=&quot;#800080&quot;&gt;6 seconds&lt;/font&gt;. When you read a &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&apos;s&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font color=&quot;#C29EFF&quot;&gt;aura&lt;/font&gt;, gain a &lt;font color=&quot;#66CCFF&quot;&gt;5% Speed Boost&lt;/font&gt; for the duration. This ability has a cooldown of &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;40&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;35&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;30&lt;/font&gt; seconds.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&quot;intense breathing.&quot;</string>
<string name="Name">perk1desc</string>
<UDim2 name="Position">
<XS>0.550000011921</XS>
<XO>0</XO>
<YS>1.978099346161</YS>
<YO>0</YO>
</UDim2>
