<XO>0</XO>
<YS>0.267221540213</YS>
<YO>0</YO>
</UDim2>
<string name="Text">Stalking and hunting is familiar enough to know everything from your victims. Whenever a &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; escapes a chase, their &lt;font color=&quot;#C29EFF&quot;&gt;aura&lt;/font&gt; is revealed to you for &lt;font color=&quot;#800080&quot;&gt;6 seconds&lt;/font&gt;. When you read a &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&apos;s&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font color=&quot;#C29EFF&quot;&gt;aura&lt;/font&gt;, gain a &lt;font color=&quot;#66CCFF&quot;&gt;5% Speed Boost&lt;/font&gt; for the duration. This ability has a cooldown of &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;40&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;35&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;30&lt;/font&gt; seconds.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
