<float name="LineHeight">0.750000000000</float>
<string name="LocalizedText">Whenever a &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; stuns you, they gain the &lt;font color=&quot;#FF7A7A&quot;&gt;Vulnerable&lt;/font&gt; Status Effect for &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;20&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;25&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;30&lt;/font&gt; seconds. The Vulnerable effect has a cooldown of &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;40 seconds&lt;/font&gt;.
Additionally, whenever a Survivor drops a &lt;font color=&quot;#7FC8F8&quot;&gt;Pallet&lt;/font&gt;, they are slowed by &lt;font color=&quot;#FF7A7A&quot;&gt;5%&lt;/font&gt; for &lt;font color=&quot;#8E63D2&quot;&gt;4 seconds&lt;/font&gt;. The slowdown has no cooldown.
&lt;br/&gt;&quot;it&apos;s like adding fuel to flame&quot;</string>
