<float name="LineHeight">0.750000000000</float>
<string name="LocalizedText">Whenever a &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; escapes chase, gain a token, up to a maximum of &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;3&lt;/font&gt;. Gaining a token has a &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;10 second&lt;/font&gt; internal cooldown. Each token gives you a &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;1&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;2&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;3&lt;/font&gt;% &lt;font color=&quot;#66CCFF&quot;&gt;Speed Boost&lt;/font&gt;. Performing a basic attack or a special attack that can damage &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivors&lt;/font&gt; removes a token.
&lt;br/&gt;&quot;For the love of the game.&quot;</string>
