<Font name="FontFace">
<Family><url>rbxassetid://12187377099</url></Family>
<Weight>400</Weight>
<Style>Normal</Style>
</Font>
<float name="LineHeight">0.750000000000</float>
<string name="LocalizedText">&lt;font color=&quot;#B97CFF&quot;&gt;Evil&apos;s Grasp&lt;/font&gt; is the ability the Stalker gains after having &lt;font color=&quot;#FFD24C&quot;&gt;5 charges&lt;/font&gt; of Stalk.
After using &lt;font color=&quot;#B97CFF&quot;&gt;Evil&apos;s Grasp&lt;/font&gt;, the Stalker runs forward attempting to grab the first survivor he gets his hands on, covering a total of &lt;font color=&quot;#FFD24C&quot;&gt;34 studs&lt;/font&gt;; after which, if he has not yet found a target, he returns to his Stalker Mode.

If the Stalker grabs a survivor using &lt;font color=&quot;#B97CFF&quot;&gt;Evil&apos;s Grasp&lt;/font&gt;, he grabs them by the neck and after a short duration throws them away, the throw afflicting the victim with the &lt;font color=&quot;#4CFF7A&quot;&gt;Anti-Heal&lt;/font&gt; status effect for the next &lt;font color=&quot;#FFD24C&quot;&gt;40 seconds&lt;/font&gt;. After this, the Stalker advances into his Hunter mode, gaining him an advantage to catch his prey faster.
</string>
<string name="Name">grasp</string>
<UDim2 name="Position">
<XS>0.490000039339</XS>
<XO>0</XO>
<YS>1.337800025940</YS>
<YO>0</YO>
</UDim2>
<bool name="RichText">true</bool>
<UDim2 name="Size">
<XS>0.939999938011</XS>
<XO>0</XO>
<YS>0.425576448441</YS>
<YO>0</YO>
</UDim2>
<string name="Text">&lt;font color=&quot;#B97CFF&quot;&gt;Evil&apos;s Grasp&lt;/font&gt; is the ability the Stalker gains after having &lt;font color=&quot;#FFD24C&quot;&gt;5 charges&lt;/font&gt; of Stalk.
After using &lt;font color=&quot;#B97CFF&quot;&gt;Evil&apos;s Grasp&lt;/font&gt;, the Stalker runs forward attempting to grab the first survivor he gets his hands on, covering a total of &lt;font color=&quot;#FFD24C&quot;&gt;34 studs&lt;/font&gt;; after which, if he has not yet found a target, he returns to his Stalker Mode.

If the Stalker grabs a survivor using &lt;font color=&quot;#B97CFF&quot;&gt;Evil&apos;s Grasp&lt;/font&gt;, he grabs them by the neck and after a short duration throws them away, the throw afflicting the victim with the &lt;font color=&quot;#4CFF7A&quot;&gt;Anti-Heal&lt;/font&gt; status effect for the next &lt;font color=&quot;#FFD24C&quot;&gt;40 seconds&lt;/font&gt;. After this, the Stalker advances into his Hunter mode, gaining him an advantage to catch his prey faster.
</string>
<Color3 name="TextColor3">
<R>1.000000000000</R>
<G>1.000000000000</G>
<B>1.000000000000</B>
</Color3>
