<float name="LineHeight">0.750000000000</float>
<string name="LocalizedText">Hunter mode is the second tier that the Stalker transitions to after successfully landing &lt;font color=&quot;#B97CFF&quot;&gt;Evil&apos;s Grasp&lt;/font&gt; on a survivor.
During this mode, the Stalker&apos;s vaulting and breaking actions are &lt;font color=&quot;#FFD24C&quot;&gt;20% faster&lt;/font&gt;.

This mode lasts a total of &lt;font color=&quot;#FFD24C&quot;&gt;70 seconds&lt;/font&gt; and increases the Stalker&apos;s movement speed to &lt;font color=&quot;#FFD24C&quot;&gt;120% / 20.4 Studs per second&lt;/font&gt;.
</string>
<string name="Name">hunter desc</string>
<UDim2 name="Position">
<XS>0.490000039339</XS>
<XO>0</XO>
<YS>0.947600007057</YS>
<YO>0</YO>
</UDim2>
<bool name="RichText">true</bool>
<UDim2 name="Size">
<XS>0.939999938011</XS>
<XO>0</XO>
<YS>0.325101137161</YS>
<YO>0</YO>
</UDim2>
<string name="Text">Hunter mode is the second tier that the Stalker transitions to after successfully landing &lt;font color=&quot;#B97CFF&quot;&gt;Evil&apos;s Grasp&lt;/font&gt; on a survivor.
During this mode, the Stalker&apos;s vaulting and breaking actions are &lt;font color=&quot;#FFD24C&quot;&gt;20% faster&lt;/font&gt;.

This mode lasts a total of &lt;font color=&quot;#FFD24C&quot;&gt;70 seconds&lt;/font&gt; and increases the Stalker&apos;s movement speed to &lt;font color=&quot;#FFD24C&quot;&gt;120% / 20.4 Studs per second&lt;/font&gt;.
</string>
