<float name="LineHeight">0.750000000000</float>
<string name="LocalizedText">Upon activation grants The Killer the Frenzy Buff, granting him various abilities such as being able to vault pallets, able to chain hits to gain movement speed and being able to track Survivors near your Killer Instinct.

Upon chaining the fourth hit down the player instead of injuring them. Cannot chain it twice on the same Survivor and getting stunned or whiffing the attack will result in losing the frenzy along with the chains.

Each chained hit grants tokens equal to its place in the chain (1, 2, 3 then 4), holding up to 4. With 3 or more tokens, vaulting a dropped pallet during Frenzy breaks it and spends 3 tokens.</string>
<string name="Name">Par1</string>
<UDim2 name="Position">
<XS>0.490000009537</XS>
<XO>0</XO>
<YS>0.399999976158</YS>
