<float name="LineHeight">0.750000000000</float>
<string name="LocalizedText">Survivors still feel helpless even after completing an objective.
Each time a Generator is completed, all Survivors will suffer from the Winded status effect as well as granting the killer Undetectable for &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;20&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;30&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;40&lt;/font&gt; seconds.&lt;br/&gt; &lt;br/&gt;&quot;I spoke to the devil in Miami, he said everything will be fine.&quot;</string>
