<float name="LineHeight">0.750000000000</float>
<string name="LocalizedText">You leave bloody messes wherever you go. Whenever you land a basic attack on a survivor, they will release blood &lt;font color=&quot;#800080&quot;&gt;2× as frequently&lt;/font&gt;, and suffer a &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;15&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;20&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;25&lt;/font&gt;% slowdown to healing on that survivor. While affected, they lose &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;10%&lt;/font&gt; of their healing progress every second nobody is healing them.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&quot;Who cares about inexperience if you leave a lasting impression.&quot;</string>
<string name="Name">perk1desc</string>
<UDim2 name="Position">
<XS>0.550000011921</XS>
<XO>0</XO>
