</Font>
<float name="LineHeight">0.750000000000</float>
<string name="LocalizedText">Chaining a &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; grants you &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;2&lt;/font&gt; Tokens, up to a maximum of &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;3&lt;/font&gt;. An additional Token is granted if you get stunned by any means. When swinging, consume a Token and increase the lunge duration by &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;30&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;40&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;50&lt;/font&gt;%.
&lt;br/&gt;&quot;How&apos;s he even surviving gun shots?&quot;</string>
<string name="Name">perk1desc</string>
<UDim2 name="Position">
<XS>0.550000011921</XS>
<XO>0</XO>
<YS>2.171500205994</YS>
<YO>0</YO>
