<float name="LineHeight">0.750000000000</float>
<string name="LocalizedText">Once a great knight to a king, on a expedition to battle creatures of the abyss.
he was unmatched with his sword and indomitable will,
but the battle against the abyss grew stronger,
and he was left fighting until his soul was no longer.
for the jester was victorious and he became the Abysswalker.</string>
