<string name="LocalizedText">The Abysswalker charges up a horizontal slash &lt;font color=&quot;rgb(255,0,0)&quot;&gt;THAT CAN BE DODGED BY CROUCHING&lt;/font&gt; and gains movement speed during build up to unleash an attack that deals damage to more than one &lt;font color=&quot;rgb(0,170,255)&quot;&gt;survivor&lt;/font&gt;. This move can be used to destroy pallets if no one is hit.</string>
