<string name="LocalizedText">The Abysswalker swings his hand for a long windup and sends out a burst of corruption that travels the whole map, &lt;font color=&quot;rgb(0,170,255)&quot;&gt;Survivors&lt;/font&gt; hit are &lt;font color=&quot;rgb(255,255,0)&quot;&gt;highlighted&lt;/font&gt; for the killer and are &lt;font color=&quot;rgb(255,255,0)&quot;&gt;slowed by 40%&lt;/font&gt; for 5 seconds. Breaking a pallet lowers the slow on every corrupted &lt;font color=&quot;rgb(0,170,255)&quot;&gt;survivor&lt;/font&gt; to 30% for the rest of its time.</string>
<string name="Name">move2</string>
