<string name="LocalizedText">Spawns &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;4&lt;/font&gt; Cursed Chains. Trapping a &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; on a Cursed Chain causes the highest-progressed Generator to explode, instantly losing &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;5&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;6&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;7&lt;/font&gt;%, plus an additional &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;5&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;6&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;7&lt;/font&gt;% per &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; repairing it at the time. This notifies you and starts regression.

&quot;By the... by the dark&quot;</string>
