<string name="Text">Hitting a &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; will make them release a corrupted trail that slows down anyone that touches it by &lt;font color=&quot;#FF7A7A&quot;&gt;7%&lt;/font&gt; for &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;20&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;25&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;30&lt;/font&gt; seconds.&lt;br/&gt; &lt;br/&gt;&quot;For I have availed you﻿ nothing.&quot;</string>
