<string name="LocalizedText">At the start of the round, gain the &lt;font color=&quot;#66CCFF&quot;&gt;Undetectable&lt;/font&gt; Status Effect for &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;30&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;45&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;60&lt;/font&gt; seconds. Additionally, whenever you Chain a &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt;, gain the &lt;font color=&quot;#66CCFF&quot;&gt;Undetectable&lt;/font&gt; Status Effect for &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;20 seconds&lt;/font&gt;.
&lt;br/&gt;&quot;Soon, I will be consumed.&quot;</string>
