<float name="LineHeight">0.750000000000</float>
<string name="LocalizedText">The Veil switches from her dagger to the spears lodged on her body. 
Press and hold the attack button to wind up and charge a spear for at least 0.4 seconds, reaching a maximum travel speed of 165 studs per second after one second. A spear held for 7 seconds throws itself. Headshots silence survivors for 15 seconds.
The spears recharge every 20 seconds up to 2 spears max. Each successful normal spear hit removes 5 seconds from the spear that is recharging.</string>
