<float name="LineHeight">0.750000000000</float>
<string name="LocalizedText">Every &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;2&lt;/font&gt; health states &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivors&lt;/font&gt; lose, the &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;2&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font color=&quot;#7FC8F8&quot;&gt;Generators&lt;/font&gt; with the highest progress begin to bleed energy, regressing at &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;120&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;140&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;160&lt;/font&gt;% of the normal regression speed for &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;45 seconds&lt;/font&gt;, even if they are being worked on. Can only affect &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;2&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font color=&quot;#7FC8F8&quot;&gt;Generators&lt;/font&gt; at a time. Has a &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;45 second&lt;/font&gt; cooldown, health states lost during it don’t count.
&lt;br/&gt;&quot;The veil doesn’t only hide you, it slows the world around you.&quot;</string>
