<Style>Normal</Style>
</Font>
<float name="LineHeight">0.750000000000</float>
<string name="LocalizedText">You get agitated thinking about chaining your victims. Pick up downed Survivors &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;25&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;33&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;50&lt;/font&gt;% faster. While carrying a Survivor, gain a &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;9&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;12&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;15&lt;/font&gt;% movement speed boost and increase your Intent Radius by &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;24&lt;/font&gt; studs. Retain this boost for &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;3&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;7&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;10&lt;/font&gt; seconds after you Chain the Survivor.
&lt;br/&gt;&quot;It&apos;s about the destination not the journey.&quot;
&quot;I see you.&quot;</string>
<string name="Name">perk1desc</string>
<UDim2 name="Position">
<XS>0.550000011921</XS>
<XO>0</XO>
<YS>1.341500520706</YS>
<YO>0</YO>
</UDim2>
