<string name="LocalizedText">Your blows are calculated and efficient. Damaging a &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; by any means applies the &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;Winded&lt;/font&gt; status effect for &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;20&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;25&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;30&lt;/font&gt; seconds. Additionally, you recover from successful basic attacks &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;0.4 seconds&lt;/font&gt; sooner.&lt;br/&gt; &lt;br/&gt;&quot;Yes I like hurting people.&quot;</string>
