<string name="LocalizedText">Landing a basic attack gives you a &lt;font color=&quot;#66CCFF&quot;&gt;5% Speed boost&lt;/font&gt; for &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;11&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;12&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;13&lt;/font&gt; seconds. If you land another basic attack during this duration, gain an additional &lt;font color=&quot;#66CCFF&quot;&gt;Speed boost&lt;/font&gt; and refresh the duration of Combo Streak.&lt;br/&gt; &lt;br/&gt;&quot;us us usus us us.&quot;</string>
