<float name="LineHeight">0.750000000000</float>
<string name="LocalizedText">Spawns &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;4&lt;/font&gt; Cursed Chains. Trapping a &lt;font color=&quot;#4A90E2&quot;&gt;Survivor&lt;/font&gt; on a Cursed Chain grants &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;2 Tokens&lt;/font&gt;, up to &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;5&lt;/font&gt;. Kicking a Generator consumes &lt;font color=&quot;#FF5E5E&quot;&gt;1 Token&lt;/font&gt; to deal an additional &lt;font color=&quot;#CD7F32&quot;&gt;4&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#3FBF3F&quot;&gt;7&lt;/font&gt;/&lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;10&lt;/font&gt;% damage.
&lt;br/&gt;&quot;Classic fix to technology in the 90s.&quot;</string>
